{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower","content_id":"601e5d13-75e1-4083-9045-2ee13a7e1c4d","description":"A statement from the government regarding the retention of elements of Grenfell Tower.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"html","command_paper_number":"","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9177028","isbn":"","title":"Grenfell Tower: statement on elements of the Tower","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"/government/publications/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>In this statement, the government recognises the deep significance of Grenfell Tower to those most affected by the tragedy.</p>\n\n<p>It thanks the independent Grenfell Tower Memorial Commission, and the community, for their work to create a lasting memorial. It refers to recent press reports about preserving parts of the Tower for possible inclusion in the memorial and confirms that steps are being taken to carefully remove and preserve these elements where possible.</p>\n\n<p>It commits to working with the Commission and the community during the memorial design process, and states that no decisions have yet been taken as to whether the requested elements will be included in the memorial.</p>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-10T12:22:13Z"}],"document_type_label":"Correspondence","documents":["<section data-module=\"ga4-link-tracker\" class=\"gem-c-attachment govuk-!-margin-bottom-6\">\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail govuk-!-display-none-print\">\n    <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"/government/publications/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower\">\n        <svg class=\"gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image gem-c-attachment__thumbnail-image--html\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 99 140\" width=\"99\" height=\"140\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <path d=\"M30,95h57v9H30V95z M30,77v9h39v-9H30z M30,122h48v-9H30V122z M12,68h9v-9h-9V68z M12,104h9v-9h-9V104z M12,86h9v-9h-9V86z M12,122h9v-9h-9V122z M87,12v27H12V12H87z M33,17h-4v8h-6v-8h-4v18h4v-7l6,0v7l4,0V17z M49,17H35l0,3h5v15h4V20l5,0V17z M68,17h-4 l-5,6l-5-6h-4v18h4l0-12l5,6l5-6l0,12h4V17z M81,32h-6V17h-4v18h10V32z M30,68h57v-9H30V68z\" stroke-width=\"0\" />\n</svg>\n\n</a></div>\n  <div class=\"gem-c-attachment__details\">\n    <h2 class=\"gem-c-attachment__title\">\n      <a class=\"govuk-link\" target=\"_self\" data-ga4-link=\"{&quot;event_name&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;attachment&quot;}\" href=\"/government/publications/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower\">Grenfell Tower: statement on elements of the Tower</a>\n</h2>\n\n\n      <p class=\"gem-c-attachment__metadata\"><span class=\"gem-c-attachment__attribute\">HTML</span></p>\n\n\n\n\n</div></section>"],"emphasised_organisations":["1390d07f-12b3-4f55-9dd5-fec5fd9e3649"],"featured_attachments":["9177028"],"first_public_at":"2026-03-10T12:22:13.000+00:00","national_applicability":{"england":{"applicable":true,"label":"England"},"northern_ireland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Northern Ireland"},"scotland":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Scotland"},"wales":{"alternative_url":"","applicable":false,"label":"Wales"}},"political":false,"tags":{"browse_pages":[]}},"document_type":"correspondence","first_published_at":"2026-03-10T12:22:13+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/publications/grenfell-tower-statement-on-elements-of-the-tower","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/publications